And before you head off, I've got some really
interesting videos exploring the making of

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.010
the movies Ex Machina and Interstellar.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.040
Click here to check those out.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.960
Thanks for watching and see ya next time!

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:36.710
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers!

